{"game": "remnant-2", "language": "english", "appid": 1282100, "month": "2026-05", "window": 4, "start_date": 1779580800, "end_date": 1780271999, "month_true_total": 200, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-12 14:58:03 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "226907245", "author": {"steamid": "76561199558950548", "personaname": "Lagrku", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199558950548/", "num_games_owned": 55, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 990, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 814, "last_played": 1780808792, "avatar": "3590a1f0dfd6c65e6d10db576bedc2dfe5271a95"}, "language": "english", "review": "i love this game played it on console glad to play it on pc now", "timestamp_created": 1780271015, "timestamp_updated": 1780271015, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226905637", "author": {"steamid": "76561198093240220", "personaname": "RatGirl", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198093240220/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 7353, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 7353, "last_played": 1780267514, "avatar": "b80e7739cae83a8cd336bea1252e374c99feae3f"}, "language": "english", "review": "  I was a fan of and played this on console before switching to PC, so I've 100% this game twice now. This game has a noticeable Souls-like style with \"bonfires\" and enemy respawn mechanics, plus the emphasis on boss fights. The reward you get for game knowledge in this game is significantly faster scrap grind as if you pick up an item you already gotten that is your reward. The amount and depth of secrets and hidden items in this game is baffling.\r\n\r\n - Find a handful of vaguely edible items? give them to the chef and get unique consumables and eventually a hidden amulet.\r\n - Run a very specific build and you can find yourself in the backrooms to get a \"hidden\" class.\r\n - Kill a specific boss with a specific weapon and you get their crown.\r\n\r\nMovement and controls are pretty responsive too and leave a ton of space for skill expression. Can take a bit to get used to though.\r\n\r\nBuild variety is one of the best out there, and with the variance of difficulty settings (plus rewards for challenging yourself) you can experiment with builds and eventually optimize for more challenging modes. There are even rewards for completing worlds and entire runs up to veteran difficulty in hardcore (permadeath).\r\n \r\nI greatly recommend this game to secret hunters and build-crafters! \r\n", "timestamp_created": 1780269045, "timestamp_updated": 1780269045, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 1, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1690300800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "226893325", "author": {"steamid": "76561198106491144", "personaname": "SeñorDonGato", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198106491144/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 2748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2305, "last_played": 1780350429, "avatar": "2d06792abe2866f693cc5ef74d6a0edfa628389f"}, "language": "english", "review": "nice game", "timestamp_created": 1780257011, "timestamp_updated": 1780257011, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_